OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage comments are
OL,4,A'madness', says business
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses, charities and politicians
OL,7,Fhave reacted to criticism of the
OL,8,Fminimum wage by the economic
OL,9,Fdevelopment minister, with one coffee
OL,10,Fshop owner calling his public comments
OL,11,F"madness".
OL,13,FEarlier this week, the chief minister
OL,14,Frejected Deputy Gerald Voisin's
OL,15,Fsuggestion that the minimum wage was
OL,16,F"strangling our economy" and said the
OL,17,Fminister's views did not reflect that
OL,18,Fof the government or States Assembly.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
