OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage comments are
OL,4,A'madness', says business
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrank De Jesus, who runs Coffee
OL,7,FRepublic, said the cost of living and
OL,8,Fof doing business in Jersey were a
OL,9,F"far-reaching issue". He has called on
OL,10,Fthe council of ministers to "get their
OL,11,Fact together" and discuss workers' pay.
OL,13,FThe BBC has contacted Voisin for
OL,14,Fcomment.
